                                        "entry_id": "bf33b1ae-124b-3324-8924-3e3a1f8cd2c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short woollen overcoat, originally as worn by sailors; a pea coat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c0e4e4f-8196-4165-a9f1-d41f0fa50674",
                                                "sense_id": "1805a0e0-cd6c-3b7b-b81f-1c81d9ff48f0",
                                                "text": "Since furs are unknown here, I decided to put on a pea-jacket [translating Schifferkutte] which we had brought with us as a joke."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
